through 8 bosses and over 90 stages in Adventure Mode.<br></li><li>Explore randomized dungeons in Dungeon Mode.<br></li><li>Solve over 100 target-breaking puzzles in Puzzle Mode, or create your own puzzles and share them with friends.<br></li><li>Survive over 10 stages of explosion-dodging challenges in Survival Mode.<br></li><li>Battle your friends in 20 different arenas in Battle Mode, with up to 4 players in online or local multiplayer.<br></li><li>Use the comprehensive Assist Mode to adjust the game to your liking by tweaking health, lives, game speed, or outright skipping troublesome stages.</li></ul>",
